{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DQpMhyTDoh7jTBT3XAXKYG","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tname: LLM Judge Style Bias — Research Landscape\n3\tdescription: 从10篇论文蒸馏的LLM-as-Judge风格偏差研究领域隐性经验：实验设计共识、方法趋势、竞品定位、研究空白\n4\ttype: research\n5\tsource_papers: 8 deep-read + 2 abstract-only (2018-2026)\n6\t---\n7\t\n8\t## 核心共识：Style 是 LLM Judge 的主宰偏差\n9\t\n10\tStyle-overall相关性R=0.999（SOS-Bench）；style bias 0.76-0.92远超position bias≤0.04（Soumik 2026）；style/format是preference leakage主载体（Preference Leakage ICLR'26）。**支持度：5/8，置信度：高。**\n11\t\n12\t## 标准实验设计模式\n13\t\n14\t**Judge模型覆盖**：至少3-5个异构LLM（GPT-4o + Claude + Gemini/Llama + 开源），跨provider验证是reviewer期待的最低标准。支持度：5/8，置信度：高（LC-AlpacaEval, SOS-Bench, Preference Leakage, Soumik, FairJudge）。\n15\t\n16\t**控制干预实验**：注入已知缺陷（事实错误/风格变化/特征抑制）量化judge敏感度差异，比纯相关性分析更有因果说服力。支持度：4/8，置信度：高（SOS-Bench的sarcasm/-96% vs wrong/-13%，CASSE的12×12矩阵，Soumik的controlled dataset）。\n17\t\n18\t**统计严谨性标配**：Bootstrap 95% CIs（n≥2000）+ McNemar/显著性检验 + Holm-Bonferroni多重比较校正。支持度：3/8，置信度：中（Soumik, Preference Leakage, RATE）。\n19\t\n20\t**半合成验证**：在已知ground truth的合成数据上先验证，再推广到真实数据。支持度：2/8，置信度：中（RATE的typo实验, Veitch的semi-synthetic peer review）。\n21\t\n22\t## 标准Benchmark与指标\n23\t\n24\t**Benchmark频率**：AlpacaEval/Arena-Hard（各2/8）、MT-Bench（2/8）、Chatbot Arena作为人类参考（2/8）。自建controlled dataset成为趋势（SOS-Bench 152K, Soumik 225, CASSE 12200）。\n25\t\n26\t**指标**：Win Rate（5/8）、Spearman Correlation with human（3/8）、Human Agreement（3/8）、Bias Score（2/8）、Cohen's kappa（2/8）。因果方向：ATE/Cohen's d（RATE）。\n27\t\n28\t## 方法论趋势\n29\t\n30\t**上升**：因果推断框架用于judge debiasing（LC-AlpacaEval用causal mediation，RATE用double-rewrite ATE，Counterfactual Rhetorical用Bradley-Terry）；LLM生成反事实文本作为干预工具；多维度交叉偏差分析。\n31\t\n32\t**消退**：单维度偏差分析（仅length或仅position）；无统计检验的裸数字比较；纯prompt工程debiasing（Soumik证明效果model-dependent）。\n33\t\n34\t## 竞品Claim与定位\n35\t\n36\t| 关系 | 论文 | 核心Claim |\n37\t|------|------|-----------|\n38\t| Competitor | Preference Leakage (ICLR'26) | 模型家族关系通过style泄漏偏好，contextual calibration降59%Error Bias |\n39\t| Competitor | Soumik (2026) | CoT是唯一universally safe策略，debiasing效果model-dependent |\n40\t| Competitor | FairJudge (2026) | 训练侧三阶段(SFT→DPO→GRPO)，8B超72B/671B |\n41\t| Foundation | LC-AlpacaEval (ICLR'25) | Length as causal mediator，回归去偏 |\n42\t| Foundation | SOS-Bench (ICLR'25) | Style-overall R=0.999，sarcasm/-96% vs wrong/-13% |\n43\t| Foundation | RATE (ICML'25) | Double-rewrite消除反事实系统误差 |\n44\t| Foundation | Counterfactual Rhetorical | Persona反事实+BT聚合度量修辞风格 |\n45\t| Complementary | CASSE (2026) | Style特征因果纠缠，mitigation面临alignment tax |\n46\t\n47\t## 研究空白（我们的机会）\n48\t\n49\t1. **多维Style因果分解**：现有工作要么把style当单一维度(length/整体style)，要么只做两两交互(CASSE)，无人做judge评分中多维style的联合因果分解。支持度：交叉盲区，置信度：高。\n50\t2. **Style bias × Preference leakage联合处理**：两类偏差被独立研究，无人考虑交互。置信度：中。\n51\t3. **Debiasing的下游对齐影响**：所有论文止步于\"judge更准了\"，无人验证去偏judge是否改善实际模型对齐。置信度：中。\n52\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9b418a75-678d-4fa3-85ef-47aa6f4921e4","uuid":"ff1d0e01-bd2a-40c0-8de9-8bed45bee40b","timestamp":"2026-05-21T14:17:06.389Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/skills/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/distilled-research.skill.md","content":"---\nname: LLM Judge Style Bias — Research Landscape\ndescription: 从10篇论文蒸馏的LLM-as-Judge风格偏差研究领域隐性经验：实验设计共识、方法趋势、竞品定位、研究空白\ntype: research\nsource_papers: 8 deep-read + 2 abstract-only (2018-2026)\n---\n\n## 核心共识：Style 是 LLM Judge 的主宰偏差\n\nStyle-overall相关性R=0.999（SOS-Bench）；style bias 0.76-0.92远超position bias≤0.04（Soumik 2026）；style/format是preference leakage主载体（Preference Leakage ICLR'26）。**支持度：5/8，置信度：高。**\n\n## 标准实验设计模式\n\n**Judge模型覆盖**：至少3-5个异构LLM（GPT-4o + Claude + Gemini/Llama + 开源），跨provider验证是reviewer期待的最低标准。支持度：5/8，置信度：高（LC-AlpacaEval, SOS-Bench, Preference Leakage, Soumik, FairJudge）。\n\n**控制干预实验**：注入已知缺陷（事实错误/风格变化/特征抑制）量化judge敏感度差异，比纯相关性分析更有因果说服力。支持度：4/8，置信度：高（SOS-Bench的sarcasm/-96% vs wrong/-13%，CASSE的12×12矩阵，Soumik的controlled dataset）。\n\n**统计严谨性标配**：Bootstrap 95% CIs（n≥2000）+ McNemar/显著性检验 + Holm-Bonferroni多重比较校正。支持度：3/8，置信度：中（Soumik, Preference Leakage, RATE）。\n\n**半合成验证**：在已知ground truth的合成数据上先验证，再推广到真实数据。支持度：2/8，置信度：中（RATE的typo实验, Veitch的semi-synthetic peer review）。\n\n## 标准Benchmark与指标\n\n**Benchmark频率**：AlpacaEval/Arena-Hard（各2/8）、MT-Bench（2/8）、Chatbot Arena作为人类参考（2/8）。自建controlled dataset成为趋势（SOS-Bench 152K, Soumik 225, CASSE 12200）。\n\n**指标**：Win Rate（5/8）、Spearman Correlation with human（3/8）、Human Agreement（3/8）、Bias Score（2/8）、Cohen's kappa（2/8）。因果方向：ATE/Cohen's d（RATE）。\n\n## 方法论趋势\n\n**上升**：因果推断框架用于judge debiasing（LC-AlpacaEval用causal mediation，RATE用double-rewrite ATE，Counterfactual Rhetorical用Bradley-Terry）；LLM生成反事实文本作为干预工具；多维度交叉偏差分析。\n\n**消退**：单维度偏差分析（仅length或仅position）；无统计检验的裸数字比较；纯prompt工程debiasing（Soumik证明效果model-dependent）。\n\n## 竞品Claim与定位\n\n| 关系 | 论文 | 核心Claim |\n|------|------|-----------|\n| Competitor | Preference Leakage (ICLR'26) | 模型家族关系通过style泄漏偏好，contextual calibration降59%Error Bias |\n| Competitor | Soumik (2026) | CoT是唯一universally safe策略，debiasing效果model-dependent |\n| Competitor | FairJudge (2026) | 训练侧三阶段(SFT→DPO→GRPO)，8B超72B/671B |\n| Foundation | LC-AlpacaEval (ICLR'25) | Length as causal mediator，回归去偏 |\n| Foundation | SOS-Bench (ICLR'25) | Style-overall R=0.999，sarcasm/-96% vs wrong/-13% |\n| Foundation | RATE (ICML'25) | Double-rewrite消除反事实系统误差 |\n| Foundation | Counterfactual Rhetorical | Persona反事实+BT聚合度量修辞风格 |\n| Complementary | CASSE (2026) | Style特征因果纠缠，mitigation面临alignment tax |\n\n## 研究空白（我们的机会）\n\n1. **多维Style因果分解**：现有工作要么把style当单一维度(length/整体style)，要么只做两两交互(CASSE)，无人做judge评分中多维style的联合因果分解。支持度：交叉盲区，置信度：高。\n2. **Style bias × Preference leakage联合处理**：两类偏差被独立研究，无人考虑交互。置信度：中。\n3. **Debiasing的下游对齐影响**：所有论文止步于\"judge更准了\"，无人验证去偏judge是否改善实际模型对齐。置信度：中。\n","numLines":52,"startLine":1,"totalLines":52}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011rXKc6UidAtRFnXEEqUTSt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the paper and review context carefully before dispatching the two reviewers.\n\nThe paper is \"The Likert Blindspot: Detecting Hidden Style Bias in LLM Judges via Controlled Style Decomposition\" — an anonymous submission proposing the CSD framework for detecting style bias in LLM judges that standard Likert evaluation misses.\n\nI need to:\n1. Dispatch R1 (methods + experiments) and R2 (novelty + related work) in parallel\n2. Then run the full roundtable (Step 1-4)\n3. Submit the final report\n\n\n4. Now I'm loading the distilled-writing skill for additional context and preparing to dispatch the two reviewers as parallel agents using the dream-review-full template.\n\nI have the full paper content and review context ready. The paper introduces CSD for detecting per-axis style bias in LLM judges, with the core finding being the \"Likert Blindspot\" — where standard Likert scoring misses hidden style biases that the framework can uncover. fails to detect biases that pairwise BT reveals\n- 5 judges (GPT-4o, Qwen3-32B, Gemini-2.0-Flash, Llama-3.3-70B, Claude Sonnet 4), 3 benchmarks (LLMBar, AlpacaEval, MT-Bench), 3 style axes (verbosity, formality, register)\n- Verbosity bias: 3/3 target judges significant (BT 66-77%)\n- Formality bias: 2/3 judges significant (conditional effect)\n- Placebo controls bound amplification to ~5-7pp\n- GEE decomposition separates style from content-quality confounds\n\nI'm mapping out the experimental coverage across the paper — most of the imagined experiments are accounted for across the tables and sections, so the validation is solid. Now I'll set both reviewers running in parallel.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33826,"cache_read_input_tokens":23947,"c