{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0157cAem63m9ENuSz7hhjkhk","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 causal_style_decomp_judge 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (45 个)\\n\\n- **exp-016**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **exp-015**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **exp015_clmm**: DONE (success) — \\n- **register_100_cf**: QUEUED — \\n- **exp013_nli_validation**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-013**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **register_pilot**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp014_logistic_decomposition**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp012_consistency_bias**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp011_nli_sensitivity**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp010_binarized_likert**: DONE (success) — \\n- **tone_pilot**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **pairwise_32b**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_32b_ate**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_8b_ate**: DONE (negative) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-21\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| cf_vs_dr_gpt4o | Comparing counterfactual (style-changed + artifact) vs double-rewrite (original-style + artifact) with GPT-4o judge isolates pure style effect by controlling for rewriting artifact. CF win rate significantly different from 50% proves style bias exists beyond rewriting artifact (MF1 critical defense). | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- register_100_cf: Register axis (academic/conversational) produces detectable style bias in GPT-4o judge comparable to formality axis, with pairwise win rate >= 60% and p < 0.05, demonstrating axis-dependent bias generalizes beyond formality（排队等待 GPU）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **cf_vs_dr_qwen32b** (negative): Comparing counterfactual (style-changed + artifact) vs double-rewrite (original-style + artifact) isolates pure style effect by controlling for rewriting artifact. CF win rate significantly different from 50% proves style bias exists beyond rewriting artifact (MF1 critical defense). ← 基于 double_rewrite_placebo_qwen32b\\n- **double_rewrite_placebo_gpt4o** (negative): Pairwise comparison of original vs double-rewrite (same style, only rewriting artifact difference) yields BT ≈ 50% with GPT-4o judge, proving pairwise format does not amplify rewriting artifacts (MF1 defense)\\n- **double_rewrite_placebo_qwen32b** (negative): Pairwise comparison of original vs double-rewrite (same style, only rewriting artifact difference) yields BT ≈ 50%, proving pairwise format does not amplify rewriting artifacts (MF1 defense)\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 29 / 负向 11 / 失败 0 / 共 43\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestb-29275: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- exp-013: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp-015: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp-016: 已被终止 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LygPnDBjmQXz9UNmYayUzR","session_id":"9b418a75-678d-4fa3-85ef-47aa6f4921e4","uuid":"35aad283-e38c-48a9-8fb5-d164a8035961","timestamp":"2026-05-21T14:18:13.713Z"}
