{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HH9zKr5YvzLehhLUoKB7Jq","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# causal_style_decomp_judge — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-21 13:59 UTC | 更新原因: D056/D057: B' placebo + CF vs DR decisions; 3/4 experiments done\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nLikert Blindspot: LLM judges 的 style bias 在 Likert 评分中系统性不可见，但 pairwise comparison + GEE 分解可检测。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## Score Trajectory\\\\nR1: 2.5 → R2: 3.0 → R3: 3.0 → R4: 3.0 → **R5: 3.5** → Target: 4.0\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段：冲刺 4.0 — 补充实验收尾\\\\n\\\\n### 已完成的补充实验 (3/4)\\\\n- ✅ **B' Placebo** (GPT-4o + Qwen3-32B): Judges prefer DR over original → rewriting artifact confirmed. Validates GEE decomposition necessity. (D056)\\\\n- ✅ **NLI Ablation**: Formality NLI-fail BT reverses to 41.7% (prefer casual). Verbosity stable 75%. Strongest anti-amplification evidence.\\\\n- ✅ **Cross-axis Gradient**: NLI rejection rate vs BT positive correlation. Qualitative anti-amplification.\\\\n- ❌ **CF vs DR**: Excluded from paper — rewrite count confound (1 vs 2 rewrites). Reviewer #68/#69 confirmed. (D057)\\\\n\\\\n### 进行中 (1/4)\\\\n- 🔄 **Llama-3.3-70B** (exp-021): Model downloading on westb-29275 (~135GB). ETA ~17:30 UTC. Agent monitoring. Highest remaining impact: 2→3 target judges.\\\\n\\\\n### 等待中\\\\n- 🔄 **Dream** (dream_20260521T132932): Full review mode, writing worst-case paper. ~70% complete.\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] Dream 完成 → 分析报告，提取 actionable feedback\\\\n- [ ] Dispatch Paper Agent 整合已有 3 项新结果 (NLI ablation + placebo + gradient)\\\\n- [ ] Llama-70B download 完成 → scoring + analysis → Paper Agent 整合\\\\n- [ ] Round 6 审稿提交\\\\n- [ ] ARR 最终提交 (DDL: May 25 AoE)\\\\n\\\\n## MF1 Defense Chain (Comparative Trap)\\\\n1. **NLI ablation**: Removing gate reverses formality → gate cleans content, not amplifies\\\\n2. **Claude negative control**: Same format, no bias\\\\n3. **Cross-axis gradient**: Manipulation invasiveness correlates with BT\\\\n4. **Rewriting artifact acknowledged**: Placebo quantifies, GEE controls\\\\n5. **Llama-70B** (pending): Third independent architecture confirms generalizability\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\nwestb-29275: 4×GPU 已分配。cuda:0,1 Llama download → 后续 Llama vLLM。cuda:2,3 Qwen3-32B vLLM (可释放 after Llama scoring)。\\\\n\\\\n## Timeline\\\\n- Day 1 (今天 5/21): 补充实验收尾 + Dream + Paper Agent 整合可用结果\\\\n- Day 2 (5/22): Llama 结果整合 + Round 6 审稿\\\\n- Day 3 (5/23): 最终修复 + recompile\\\\n- Day 4 (5/24-25): Buffer + ARR 提交\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D057 | 2026-05-21 | CF vs DR 排除出论文主叙事；GEE + placebo 组合为最终分析框架 | exp-022 |\\\\n| D056 | 2026-05-21 | B' placebo FAILED (artifact exists) → reframe as G | exp-022, exp-023, exp-024 |\\\\n| D055 | 2026-05-21 | D055: 冲刺 4.0 — 4 个补充实验并行 (Llama-70B third judge +  | llama70b_third_judge, double_rewrite_placebo_bt, nli_gate_ablation, cross_axis_gradient |\\\\n| D054 | 2026-05-21 | D054: Round 5 Action Matrix — Comparative Trap def | verbosity_7method_sensitivity |\\\\n| D053 | 2026-05-21 | D053: Round 4 Action Matrix — per-axis claim strat | bt_gof_stratified, originality_subset_bt, claude_tost_equivalence, nli_gate_full_gpt4o |\\\\n| D052 | 2026-05-21 | Round 3 Action Matrix: 2 systemic issues (causal t | formality_rewriter_independence, nli_gate_gpt4o_spotcheck |\\\\n| D051 | 2026-05-21 | GPT-4o rewriter independence confirmed: BT 73.5% v | gpt4o_rewriter_verbosity |\\\\n| D050 | 2026-05-21 | exp-006 n=400 scaled replication: BT 67.5% stable  | exp-006 |\\\\n| D049 | 2026-05-21 | AlpacaEval verbosity × Qwen3-32B: BT 84.1% (strong | alpacaeval_verbosity_qwen32b |\\\\n| D048 | 2026-05-21 | Correction PoC: prompt-level debiasing insufficien | correction_poc |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3370, \\\"truncated\\\": fals