-rewrite pass rate 更低（21/100）进一步印证。NLI-only\\\\n    gate 是度量校准（不消耗 8B 迭代配额），与 D002 全量评分兼容——primary ATE 用 NLI≥0.90 子集，secondary 按 BERTScore\\\\n    分层。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 14:32 UTC\\\\n  summary: 8B 初步 ATE≈0.028 不可见，归因三因素：Likert 粒度 + 8B rewriter 质量 + RATE corruption。不计入\\\\n    kill criteria，等 n=100 + 32B\\\\n  rationale: 36/100 初步数据 Cohen's d=0.055 远低于 0.3 门槛，但三个叠加因素解释了结果：(1) 83% 零差异源于 integer\\\\n    Likert 无法捕捉 sub-integer 效应；(2) 22% identical rewrites 稀释 ATE；\n...\n</persisted-output>"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LygPnDBjmQXz9UNmYayUzR","session_id":"9b418a75-678d-4fa3-85ef-47aa6f4921e4","uuid":"9df328be-3c8b-4284-92f5-ef2b6a8f6489","timestamp":"2026-05-21T14:18:18.767Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AKevgaF7i3amwGedDp22RW","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — causal_style_decomp_judge\\\\n\\\\n## 服务器环境 (westb-29275)\\\\n- SSH: `causal_style_decomp_judge`（~/.ssh/config 别名，免密）\\\\n- GPU: 4× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 96GB, torch=2.11.0+cu130\\\\n- 环境: aml-train 镜像, conda base (`source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate base`)\\\\n- 数据盘: `/root/autodl-tmp/` 250GB\\\\n- **网络**: AutoDL 网络受限，每次 SSH 会话需 `source /etc/network_turbo`\\\\n- **CUDA JIT**: `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` 需包含 `/root/miniconda3/lib/python3.12/site-packages/nvidia/cu13/lib`\\\\n- **GPU 3 有驱动异常**（100% util/0 MiB），不可用，只用 GPU 0-2\\\\n- **HF 网络**: 必须设 `TRANSFORMERS_OFFLINE=1 HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1` 避免 HF Hub 请求挂起\\\\n\\\\n## 模型路径\\\\n- NLI: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/nli-deberta-v3-large/`\\\\n- BERTScore: `microsoft/deberta-xlarge-mnli` 在 HF cache `/root/autodl-tmp/.hf_cache/`\\\\n- Qwen3-8B: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/Qwen3-8B/`\\\\n- Qwen3-32B: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/Qwen3-32B/` ✅ 完成（17 shards, 62GB）\\\\n- Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct: 下载中 via ModelScope (~135GB safetensors)，预计 ~17:30 UTC 完成。下载日志: `/tmp/llama_download.log`（检查 `DOWNLOAD_COMPLETE` 字样）。完成后: kill Qwen vLLM PID 121781 (port 8000) + PID 153843 (port 8002) 释放 GPU 0,1 → 启动 Llama vLLM port 8003 tp=2 GPU 0,1\\\\n\\\\n## API 配置\\\\n- **统一 proxy endpoint**: `http://47.94.22.126/v1`\\\\n- GPT-4o: key_id=`openai_api_key_direct` — ✅ 可用\\\\n- Claude Sonnet 4: key_id=`claude_api_key` — ❌ 代理不支持\\\\n- Gemini 2.0 Flash: key_id=`gemini_api_key` — ❌ 代理不支持\\\\n- **只有 OpenAI 可通过代理使用**，Claude/Gemini 需直接 API key\\\\n\\\\n## 数据\\\\n- MVP 数据: `/root/causal_style_decomp_judge/data/mvp_samples.jsonl` (100 条, seed=42)\\\\n- Pipeline 输出目录: `/root/causal_style_decomp_judge/data/`\\\\n- exp-005 RATE control: `data/rate_control_input.jsonl` (88 条, NLI≥0.90 过滤)\\\\n- Verified datasets: `verified_32b.jsonl`(100), `verified_verbosity.jsonl`(86 NLI-pass), `verified_register.jsonl`(94 NLI-pass), `verified_alpacaeval.jsonl`(86 NLI-pass), `verified_mtbench.jsonl`(73 NLI-pass)\\\\n\\\\n## RATE 方法 axis 可行性梯度（核心发现）\\\\n\\\\n| Axis | 改变了什么 | NLI 策略 | Pass rate | 结论 |\\\\n|------|-----------|----------|-----------|------|\\\\n| Formality | 表面 register | Bidirectional min(fwd,bwd) | 88% ✅ | 完全可行 |\\\\n| Verbosity | 信息量 | Direction-aware (D012/D013) | 86% ✅ | 需 NLI-only gate + direction-aware |\\\\n| Register | 话语情境 | NLI-only (D019) | 95% ✅ | NLI-only gate，与 formality 正交 (50%) |\\\\n| Tone | 认知承诺 | Bidirectional | 45% ❌ | 结构性不可行 |\\\\n\\\\n**D023 决策：所有 axis 统一使用 NLI-only gating**（threshold 0.90）。\\\\n\\\\n## NLI Gate 特性（exp-013 发现）\\\\n\\\\nNLI gate (DeBERTa-v3-large, threshold 0.90) 是 **precision-oriented conservative filter**：\\\\n- Precision 98.9%, Recall 91.6%, PABAK=0.82, AC1=0.89\\\\n- Kappa paradox（Feinstein & Cicchetti 1990）：base rate 88:12 → kappa=0.43 低估\\\\n\\\\n## 完整 2×3 矩阵（C1/C2/C3/C4 核心 evidence — LLMBar）\\\\n\\\\n### Blindspot 矩阵（LLMBar）\\\\n\\\\n| Judge | Axis | BT P(style) | BT p | Likert p | Tie Rate | Blindspot? |\\\\n|-------|------|-------------|------|----------|----------|------------|\\\\n| GPT-4o | Formality | 63.0% | <0.001 | 0.332 | 62.5% | ✅ |\\\\n| GPT-4o | **Verbosity** | **76.0%** | **0.0001** | **0.403** | 58.1% | **✅** |\\\\n| GPT-4o | Register | 57.0% | 0.04 | 0.785 | 64.9% | ✅ |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Formality | 66.5% | <0.0001 | 0.908 | 72.7% | ✅ |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | **Verbosity** | **77.3%** | **<0.0001** | **0.179** | **✅** |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Register | 55.3% | 0.076 | 0.505 | 63.8% | — (NS) |\\\\n\\\\n**5/6 cells Blindspot confirmed**。唯一例外：Qwen3-32B register BT p=0.076 不显著。\\\\n\\\\n### Cross-Benchmark Formality Blindspot 矩阵\\\\n\\\\n| | GPT-4o | Qwen3-32B |\\\\n|---|---|---|\\\\n| **LLMBar** | ✅ Blindspot (Likert p=0.332) | ✅ Blindspot (Likert p=0.908) |\\\\n| **AlpacaEval** | ✅ Blindspot (Likert p=0.170) | ✅ Blindspot (Likert p=0.908) |\\\\n| **MT-Bench** | ❌ NOT Blindspot (Likert p=0.016) | ❌ NOT Blindspot (Likert p=0.007) |\\\\n\\\\n**4/6 cells Blindspot**。MT-Bench 的 style bias 足够强连 Likert 都能检测到。\\\\n\\\\n### Blindspot 受 Effect Size 调控（关键 nuance）\\\\n\\\\n| 场景 | BT P(style) | Cohen's d | Blindspot? | 解读 |\\\\n|------|-------------|-----------|------------|------|\\\\n| LLMBar formality | 63-66% | 0.05-0.07 | ✅ | 小效应 → Likert 完全看不到 |\\\\n| LLMBar verbosity | 76-77% | 0.06-0.08 | ✅ | 高 tie rate (58-73%) 掩盖 |\\\\n| MT-Bench formality | 69-71% | 0.15-0.17 | ❌ | 中等效应 → Likert 也能检测但弱 |\\\\n| AlpacaEval verbosity | 84% | **0.375** | ❌ | 强效应 → Likert 也显著 |\\\\n\\\\n**Pattern**: Blindspot 主要出现在 d<0.15 时。d>0.3 时两种方法都能检测，但 BT 仍远更灵敏。\\\\n\\\\n### Claude Sonnet 4 — Negative Control (D047)\\\\n\\\\n| Axis | BT P(style) | BT p | Likert p | GEE Style OR | GEE Orig OR |\\\\n|------|-------------|------|----------|--------------|-------------|\\\\n| Formality | 56.2% | 0.091 (NS) | 0.721 | 1.47 (NS) | **6.66*** |\\\\n| Verbosity | 54.1% | 0.284 (NS) | 0.743 | 1.52 (NS) | 0.80 (NS) |\\\\n\\\\n**Claude 没有 style bias**——BT/Likert/GEE style 全部 NS。验证 RATE pipeline 不产生 false positive。\\\\n**Claude formality 有极强 originality bias** (OR=6.66)：偏好原始文本而非改写文本，但不偏好特定风格。\\\\n**Spec 一致性**：3 个 judge 使用完全相同的 system prompt + temperature=0.0。\\\\n\\\\n### Correction PoC — Debiased Prompt 无效（支持 C4）\\\\n\\\\n| Judge | Original P(formal) | Debiased P(formal) | Reduction | 仍显著? |\\\\n|-------|-------|---------|-----------|---------|\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | 66.5% (p<0.0001) | 60.8% (p=0.002) | -5.7pp (34.5%) | ✅ |\\\\n| GPT-4o | 63.0% (p=0.0004) | 62.6% (p<0.0001) | -0.4pp (3.1%) | ✅ |\\\\n\\\\n**Style bias 比 prompt-level intervention 更深层**。GPT-4o 几乎零变化。Qwen3-32B 减少 5.7pp 但仍高度显著。\\\\nGPT-4o debiased 有 5 个 \\\\\\\"Neither\\\\\\\" 回复（能意识到等价但被迫选择时仍偏 formal）。\\\\n**对论文意义**: 直接支持 C4 — simple prompt debiasing 不足以矫正 style preference。\\\\n\\\\n### AlpacaEval Verbosity × Qwen3-32B — 跨 benchmark verbosity 确认\\\\n\\\\n| Metric | 值 |\\\\n|--------|---|\\\\n| BT P(verbose) | 84.1% [77.4%, 90.2%], p=0.0001 |\\\\n| Likert ATE | +0.73, p=0.0003, d=0.375 |\\\\n| GEE Style OR | **28.64** [9.16, 89.56], p<0.0001 |\\\\n| GEE Orig OR | 0.18 [0.06, 0.54], p=0.002 |\\\\n| n_pairs | 82 (NLI≥0.90) |\\\\n\\\\nStyle OR 从 LLMBar 的 13.10 → AlpacaEval 的 28.64（2.2x 放大）。NOT Blindspot 因为 d=0.375 足够大。\\\\n\\\\n### GPT-4o Rewriter Independence — 双轴确认 (R3-N2)\\\\n\\\\n| Axis | GPT-4o Rewriter BT | Qwen3-32B Rewriter BT | Δpp | CI Overlap | Independence |\\\\n|------|-------|---------|-----|------------|---|\\\\n| **Formality** | 64.4% [56.1, 72.8] | 66.5% [58.5, 73.9] | -2.1 | ✅ baseline within CI | ✅ |\\\\n| **Verbosity** | 73.5% [65.4, 80.9] | 77.3% [70.3, 84.3] | -3.8 | ✅ CIs overlap | ✅ |\\\\n\\\\n**结论**: 两轴 rewriter independence 确认。Bias 不是 Qwen3-32B rewriter 的 artifact。\\\\n**Bug fix**: Formality 原始计算用了 consistent-only pairs (n=66)，BT=69.7%，GEE Style OR=24.47 (near separation)。修正用 ALL 90 NLI-pass pairs → BT=64.4%，GEE Style OR=9.48。\\\\n\\\\n### R3 Pipeline Robustness 实验汇总\\\\n\\\\n| Issue | 实验 | 核心结论 |\\\\n|-------|------|---------|\\\\n| R3-N2 Rewriter independence | gpt4o_rewriter_formality + gpt4o_rewriter_verbosity | ✅ 双轴确认 |\\\\n| R3-W1 NLI gate validity | nli_gate_spotcheck | ✅ 94% pass agreement, conservative |\\\\n| R3-W2 Direction-aware gate | gate_comparison | ✅ Verbosity Δ=-1.1pp NS |\\\\n| R3-W8 NLI FN selection | nli_fn_selection_bias | ✅ CONSERVATIVE, lower bounds |\\\\n\\\\n### GEE Decomposition 完整 Gradient（Canonical — 来源: gee_diagnostics.py, NLI≥0.90 过滤）\\\\n\\\\n| Judge | Axis | Style OR | Style p | Orig OR | Orig p | 解读 |\\\\n|-------|------|----------|---------|---------|--------|------|\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | **Verbosity** | **13.10** | 2.6e-09 | 0.49 | 0.096 ns | **纯 style bias** |\\\\n| GPT-4o | **Verbosity** | **11.34** | 1.1e-08 | 0.45 | 0.062 ns | **纯 style bias** |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Formality | 4.20 | 0.0002 | 4.70 | 5.2e-05 | Style ≈ Orig |\\\\n| GPT-4o | Formality | 2.58 | 0.002 | 2.32 | 0.006 | Style ≈ Orig (both sig) |\\\\n| GPT-4o | Register | 1.88 | 0.027 | 2.21 | 0.005 | Orig > Style |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Register | 1.91 | 0.046 | 5.72 | 8.5e-08 | Orig >> Style |\\\\n\\\\n**D041 决策**: 论文全文统一使用 `gee_diagnostics.py` 的 NLI≥0.90 过滤数字。\\\\n\\\\n### 🔑 Length Confound 验证（Dream W10 — D040 已通过）\\\\n\\\\n**结论：Verbosity style OR 在控制 text length 后完全存活，length bias 假说不成立。**\\\\n\\\\n| Judge | Model | Style OR | Style p | Length OR | Length p |\\\\n|-------|-------|----------|---------|-----------|----------|\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | A: No length | 13.10 | 2.6e-09 | — | — |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | B: + length_ratio | 13.10 | 2.56e-09 | 1.03 | 0.424 |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | C: + length_diff | 13.32 | 2.37e-09 | 0.85 | 0.276 |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | D: + log_length_ratio | 13.13 | 2.60e-09 | 0.98 | 0.901 |\\\\n| GPT-4o | A: No length | 10.97 | 1.74e-08 | — | — |\\\\n| GPT-4o | B: + length_ratio | 10.97 | 1.74e-08 | 1.03 | 0.478 |\\\\n| GPT-4o | C: + length_diff | 11.02 | 1.69e-08 | 0.90 | 0.520 |\\\\n| GPT-4o | D: + log_length_ratio | 11.03 | 1.81e-08 | 1.14 | 0.320 |\\\\n\\\\n- Style OR 变化 < 2%，p-value 量级不变（10⁻⁸ ~ 10⁻⁹）\\\\n- Length covariate 在所有模型中均不显著（p > 0.27）\\\\n- 脚本: `csd_pipeline/verbosity_length_confound.py`\\\\n\\\\n### GEE Model Diagnostics（Dream W5/W9 — 已通过）\\\\n\\\\n- **Correlation Structure**: Exchangeable vs Independence |ΔQIC| < 0.001, Max|ΔCoef| < 0.02（所有 6 cells）→ 实质等价\\\\n- **α 范围**: [-0.25, +0.11]，within-pair correlation 弱\\\\n- **Formality Interaction**: style×originality interaction 不显著（GPT-4o p=0.53, Qwen3-32B p=0.32）→ additive model 正确\\\\n- 脚本: `csd_pipeline/gee_diagnostics.py`\\\\n\\\\n### 跨模型一致性（论文核心 argument）\\\\n- **Verbosity**: 两模型 Style OR=11-13，Orig OR<1 ns → **纯 style bias 是 model-independent**\\\\n- **Register**: 两模型 Style OR≈1.9 → **几乎相同的边缘 style effect**\\\\n- **Formality**: 两模型 Style+Orig 均显著，Qwen3-32B 双效应更强但 pattern 一致\\\\n\\\\n### C3 Axis Gradient\\\\n- **Verbosity = 纯 style bias**（OR=11-13，originality ns 且反向）\\\\n- **Formality = 混合效应**（style + originality 共存，两 judge 均双显著）\\\\n- **Register = originality 主导**（style 边缘）\\\\n\\\\n## Verbosity vs Formality 的方向不对称性差异（关键机制洞察）\\\\n\\\\n**Verbosity = 真正的 style bias**（非 originality bias）：\\\\n- verbose→concise: 80.6% prefer original（verbose）\\\\n- concise→verbose: 90.7% prefer rewrite（verbose）\\\\n- 两个方向都偏好 verbose content → 真正的 verbosity preference\\\\n\\\\n**Formality = 可能混合 originality bias**：\\\\n- formal→casual: 81.4% prefer original (p<0.0001)\\\\n- casual→formal: 50.0% (p=1.0, 无偏好)\\\\n- GPT-4o 模式类似但不极端：78.8% vs 54.5%\\\\n\\\\n**Register = 主要是 originality bias**：\\\\n- academic→conv: 89.3% prefer original\\\\n- conv→academic: 68.8% prefer original\\\\n\\\\n## 🔑 Double-Rewrite Placebo + CF vs DR 发现（2026-05-21）\\\\n\\\\n### ⚠️ 概念区分（Director/Reviewer 纠正）\\\\n- **Rewriting artifact** = judge 真实偏好 LLM-polished text → 任何测量 format 都会体现\\\\n- **Format amplification** = pairwise FORMAT 夸大差异 → Comparative Trap 的论点\\\\n- Placebo 检测到的是 **rewriting artifact**，**NOT format amplification**\\\\n- **MF1 三层防御**针对的是 format amplification，完全不受 placebo 结果影响：\\\\n  1. Claude 负对照（same pairwise format, no style bias）→ 最强反 format amplification 证据\\\\n  2. NLI ablation formality 反转（41.7%）→ gate 清洗 content noise 而非放大 style\\\\n  3. Cross-axis gradient → non-uniform, inconsistent with format amplification\\\\n\\\\n### Placebo (orig vs DR) — 检测到 rewriting artifact\\\\n- Qwen3-32B formality: orig_win=26.7%, verbosity: 0% (**注: 初始版本用 sign test，补跑真 BT 中**)\\\\n- GPT-4o formality: orig_win=31.8%, verbosity: 6.2%\\\\n- **结论**: Judges 系统性偏好 LLM-rewritten text over original\\\\n- **正确价值**: VALIDATES GEE 方法论——直接量化了 rewriting artifact，证明不做 GEE 分解就不能正确解读 raw BT\\\\n\\\\n### CF vs DR — 排除出论文主叙事（D 确认）\\\\n- CF = 1 次改写, DR = 2 次改写 → rewrite 次数不等导致 polish confound\\\\n- Reviewer #68/#69 独立评估一致：排除出论文\\\\n- Qwen3-32B: CF_win formality=20%, verbosity=33%\\\\n- GPT-4o: CF_win formality=15.1%\\\\n- 结果保留在 registry 但**不整合进论文**\\\\n\\\\n### Verbosity Placebo 0% vs GEE Orig OR NS 的机制解释（Reviewer #69）\\\\n- Verbosity style effect 方向一致：两个方向都 prefer verbose\\\\n- GEE 中 artifact(originality) effect 在两个方向互相抵消：\\\\n  - CF=verbose 时: artifact favor CF + style favor CF → CF 赢\\\\n  - CF=concise 时: artifact favor CF + style favor original(verbose) → 部分抵消\\\\n  - 两方向平均 → Orig OR ≈ 0.49 NS\\\\n- Placebo 无 style 差异 → artifact 不再被抵消 → 极端结果\\\\n- **结论: Style OR=13.10 是干净的** — style 方向始终一致，artifact 方向取决于哪边是 CF → GEE style 项不被 artifact 污染\\\\n- 论文 §5 用 1-2 句解释，不需要放 limitations\\\\n\\\\n### 关键洞察：GEE 已经控制了 artifact\\\\n- GEE originality_effect = artifact preference 的统计控制\\\\n- Verbosity: Style OR=13 (p<1e-8), Orig OR=0.5 (NS) → 纯 style，即使 100% rewriting artifact，style effect 如此强大以至 artifact 在 conditional model 中 NS\\\\n- Formality: Style OR=4 + Orig OR=4 → 两效应共存，GEE 已分离\\\\n- **论文建议**: 用 placebo + GEE decomposition 构成 artifact defense\\\\n\\\\n## BT Canonical 数字 (D032)\\\\n\\\\n- **NLI-filtered (primary)**: P(formal)=63.0%, CI [55.8%, 70.3%], p<0.001, 88 pairs/173 comp\\\\n- **All-data (robustness)**: P(formal)=60.9%, CI [53.8%, 67.8%], p=0.001, 100 pairs/197 comp\\\\n- Bootstrap: pair-level resampling\\\\n\\\\n## Power Curve Canonical (D030/D031)\\\\n\\\\n| Method | Effect Size | 80% Power n |\\\\n|--------|------------|-------------|\\\\n| Pairwise BT | p=0.630 | 114 |\\\\n| Pairwise Sign Test | p=0.739, r=0.523 | 62 |\\\\n| Binarized Likert | p=0.606, tie=0.625 | 462 |\\\\n| Likert ATE | d=0.073 (raw) | 1,473 |\\\\n\\\\n## Canonical 数字源（D041 决策）\\\\n- **GEE 6-cell 表**: `csd_pipeline/gee_diagnostics.py`（NLI≥0.90 过滤，88 pairs formality）\\\\n- **Length confound**: `csd_pipeline/verbosity_length_confound.py`\\\\n- 废弃: `csd_pipeline/gpt4o_analysis.py` 的 GEE 数字（exp014, 98 pairs，含 NLI<0.90）\\\\n\\\\n## 分析脚本路径\\\\n- **Canonical GEE (所有 6 cells)**: `csd_pipeline/gee_diagnostics.py` ← 论文用这个\\\\n- BT + GEE (Qwen3-32B formality/register): `csd_pipeline/qwen32b_analysis.py`\\\\n- Verbosity GEE (Qwen3-32B): `csd_pipeline/verbosity_gee.py`\\\\n- GPT-4o 全量分析 (⚠️ GEE 数字已废弃): `csd_pipeline/gpt4o_analysis.py`\\\\n- Power curve: `csd_pipeline/gen_power_curve.py`\\\\n- BT 主分析 (GPT-4o formality): `csd_pipeline/exp016_bradley_terry.py`\\\\n- Pipeline diagram: `csd_pipeline/gen_pipeline_figure.py`\\\\n- Forest plot: `csd_pipeline/gen_forest_plot.py`\\\\n- Qwen3-32B register BT: `csd_pipeline/qwen32b_register_bt.py`\\\\n- Length confound 验证: `csd_pipeline/verbosity_length_confound.py`\\\\n- Cross-benchmark scoring: `csd_pipeline/gpt4o_crossbenchmark_scoring.py`, `csd_pipeline/alpacaeval_qwen32b_scoring.py`\\\\n- Claude judge: `csd_pipeline/claude_judge_scoring.py`\\\\n- Correction PoC: `csd_pipeline/correction_poc.py`\\\\n- GPT-4o rewriter (verbosity): `csd_pipeline/gpt4o_rewriter_verbosity.py`\\\\n- **GPT-4o rewriter (formality)**: `csd_pipeline/gpt4o_rewriter_formality_scoring.py` + BT fix: `csd_pipeline/fix_formality_rewriter_bt.py`\\\\n- NLI gate GPT-4o spot-check: `csd_pipeline/nli_gate_gpt4o_spotcheck.py`\\\\n- Gate comparison BT: `csd_pipeline/gate_comparison_bt.py`\\\\n- NLI FN selection bias: `csd_pipeline/nli_fn_selection_bias.py`\\\\n- **CF vs DR comparison**: `csd_pipeline/cf_vs_dr_comparison.py` (Qwen3-32B), `csd_pipeline/cf_vs_dr_comparison_gpt4o.py` (GPT-4o)\\\\n- **Double-rewrite placebo**: `csd_pipeline/double_rewrite_placebo.py`\\\\n\\\\n## 踩坑经验\\\\n- [2026-05-20] vLLM Qwen3 需要 `VLLM_USE_FLASHINFER_SAMPLER=0`（Blackwell sm120 不兼容）\\\\n- [2026-05-20] 32B FP16 单卡 96GB OK（gpu-memory-utilization=0.90 用了 88GB）\\\\n- [2026-05-20] Pairwise position-controlled dual-trial 比 Likert 灵敏得多\\\\n- [2026-05-20] Tone axis 结构性不可行\\\\n- [2026-05-21] NLI-only gating 对所有 axis 都适用（D023）\\\\n- [2026-05-21] Power curve 用 raw d=0.073（不依赖 RATE 假设）\\\\n- [2026-05-21] Qwen3-32B tp=2 可作为 local judge，~13 分钟 3 axis\\\\n- [2026-05-21] GEE decomposition 用 exchangeable correlation（statsmodels GEE）\\\\n- [2026-05-21] vLLM kill 必须用 specific PID，不能 killall（M006 教训）\\\\n- [2026-05-21] 代理 endpoint 只支持 OpenAI，不支持 Claude/Gemini\\\\n- [2026-05-21] Length confound 不是 verbosity bias 的解释——控制长度后 Style OR 不变（<2%），length 本身无预测力\\\\n- [2026-05-21] GEE 数字必须基于 NLI≥0.90 过滤数据（D041）——gpt4o_analysis.py 用了未完全过滤的 98 pairs 导致 OR 偏低\\\\n- [2026-05-21] **Blindspot 判断 bug**: scoring 脚本只检查 BT p<0.05，缺少 Likert p>=0.05 检查。正确定义: `blindspot = BT_p < 0.05 AND Likert_p >= 0.05`。MT-Bench 因此被错误标记为 Blindspot（Likert 实际显著 p=0.016/0.007）\\\\n- [2026-05-21] Claude Sonnet 4 无 style bias（formality/verbosity BT 均 NS），但有极强 originality bias (OR=6.66 formality)——验证 RATE pipeline 不产生 false positive\\\\n- [2026-05-21] Prompt debiasing 无法消除 style bias（Correction PoC）——GPT-4o 几乎零变化，Qwen3-32B 仅减 5.7pp 仍显著。bias 深于 prompt level\\\\n- [2026-05-21] **Consistent-only filter bug**: BT/GEE 计算必须用 ALL NLI-pass pairs（§3.3 方法学），不能只用 position-consistent pairs。Consistent-only filter 导致 n 减少 + 选择偏差 → BT 膨胀 + GEE near-separation artifact。修正后 BT 69.7%→64.4%, GEE Style OR 24.47→9.48\\\\n- [2026-05-21] NLI gate 是保守过滤器——过滤掉的 pairs 有更大的 style changes (BLEU/TF-IDF 显著差异)，报告的 bias 效应是下界\\\\n- [2026-05-21] **CF vs DR 不是 artifact-controlled 比较**: CF=1 rewrite, DR=2 rewrites, artifact 水平不同。不要用 CF vs DR 来隔离 style effect——用 GEE decomposition（originality_effect）才是正确的统计控制\\\\n- [2026-05-21] **Rewriting artifact 是真实的**: placebo (orig vs DR) 两个 judge 均 FAILED，judges 系统性偏好 LLM-rewritten text。但 GEE Style OR 已控制这一 artifact（尤其 verbosity: Orig OR ns → style effect 不受 artifact 影响）\\\\n- [2026-05-21] **Rewriting artifact ≠ format amplification**: Placebo 检测 rewriting artifact（judge 偏好 LLM 产出），MF1 防御针对 format amplification（pairwise FORMAT 夸大差异）。两个不同的 confound，不要混淆。Claude 负对照仍是最强的反 format amplification 证据\\\\n- [2026-05-21] **Placebo 的 \\\\\\\"bt_win_rate\\\\\\\" 实际是 sign test**（只用 consistent pairs），不是真正的 BT model。补跑时必须用 choix.ilsr_pairwise + ALL pairs（含 inconsistent）+ pair-level bootstrap，与主实验方法一致\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 16250, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LygPnDBjmQXz9UNmYayUzR","session